OL,3,GNEWSARacecourse calls off opener over
OL,4,Aground conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA racecourse has abandoned its opening
OL,7,Fmeeting of the season due to the impact
OL,8,Fof drought conditions on the course.
OL,10,FFollowing a visit from the British
OL,11,FHorseracing Authority (BHA) on Monday,
OL,12,FFakenham Racecourse in Norfolk has
OL,13,Fcalled off its Season Opener Raceday on
OL,14,F16 October to allow new grass seed to
OL,15,Fbe established.
OL,17,FOrganisers said the safety of horses
OL,18,Fand jockeys was its priority, and it
OL,19,Fhoped to welcome spectators back on 2
OL,20,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
