OL,3,GNEWSARacecourse calls off opener over
OL,4,Aground conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Hunter, chief executive and clerk
OL,7,Fof the course, said: "We've had the
OL,8,Fhottest and longest and driest summer
OL,9,Fprobably on record and certainly the
OL,10,Flongest and driest summer that I have
OL,11,Fknown in my 30 years at Fakenham."
